格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"One-click enter/exit Plan mode for the DSH web input bar, a quick-click shortcut for /plan","id":"gh:1336486034","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plan-switch","slug":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-plan-switch","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","plan-mode"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"One-click enter/exit Plan mode for the DSH web input bar, a quick-click shortcut for /plan"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plan-switch 📋"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A one-click **enter/exit Plan mode** button for the DSH web input bar (a quick-click shortcut for `/"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"plan`) — a plugin for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) web."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"*Unofficial project: independently developed and maintained by a community member, not an official D"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ct: independently developed and maintained by a community member, not an official DeepSeek product.*"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> ## ⚠️ DISCONTINUED (2026-10-01)\n>\n> **DSH 0.2 already ships Plan mode entry points**: pick 「计划」in "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"the composer's `+` Command menu, or type `/plan`; exit with the official 「计划」status badge in the com"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"poser. This plugin only saved you one click (plus pending-guard / auto-hide), so the official build "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"leaves no capability gap — the author has uninstalled it and stopped maintaining it.\n>\n> - **Last re"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"lease: `v0.4.1`** (verified on DSH 0.2.0-rc.2). No further fixes or compatibility work.\n> - It has b"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"een removed from the author's three profiles (desktop / web / sandbox). You may keep installing it, "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"but compatibility going forward is at your own risk.\n> - What to use instead: the `/plan` command, o"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"r 「计划」in the composer `+` menu; exit via the 「计划」badge in the composer.\n> - Thanks to everyone who u"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"n the composer `+` menu; exit via the 「计划」badge in the composer.\n> - Thanks to everyone who used it."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshot"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The checklist icon button at the left end of the input tool row (official DSH design tokens, follows"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"button at the left end of the input tool row (official DSH design tokens, follows dark/light theme)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **One-click enter/exit Plan mode**: a checklist icon button at the left end of the input tool row;"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" clicking it runs the official `/plan` toggle command.\n- **Hides while Plan mode is active**: the bu"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"tton hides itself and the official plan card takes over the status display — there is never a duplic"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ated indicator.\n- **Pending-switch guard**: while a `/plan` toggle is queued, the button is disabled"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" (the same \"switching\" semantics as the official plan chip), so a stray click can't reverse the swit"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ch.\n- **Live state**: the button follows the plan state through the official projection, so changes "},{"id":"p10s7","text":"from any entry point (`/plan` command, official chip, agent switching mid-run) are reflected in real"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ny entry point (`/plan` command, official chip, agent switching mid-run) are reflected in real time."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Official bundle install (one line):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after installing (bundle layers are composed at startup). Requires pnpm on PATH (`"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"dsh plugin` forwards to pnpm)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Manual mount (fallback): see docs/install.md — symlink into `~/.dsh/profiles/web/node_modules/` plus"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" a single entry in `~/.dsh/cordis.patch.yml`, then restart."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"A checklist icon button appears at the left end of the input tool row (official DSH design tokens, f"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ollows dark/light theme). Click it to enter plan mode — the same as typing `/plan`. While plan mode "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"is active the button hides itself: the official plan card takes over the status display, so there is"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" never a duplicated indicator; while a `/plan` toggle is pending the button is disabled, so a second"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" click can't reverse the switch."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Platform support"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Platform | Status |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| macOS | ✅ fully tested (development environment) |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- DSH web >= 0.1.0-rc.6 (run with `dsh web`) — the code calls `commands.execute` with the 3-argument"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" contract (rc.8+) and auto-degrades to the 2-argument one on rc.6/rc.7\n- **Version compatibility**:\n"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"- ✅ **DSH 0.1.7 and later — use this release (`v0.4.1`)**: it declares `peerDependencies: {\"@deepsee"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"k-ai/dsh\": \"^0.1.7-rc.1 || ^0.2.0-rc.1\"}`, so a mismatched host refuses to load it with an explicit "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"reason instead of failing quietly. Settings move to the 0.1.7 model (plugin `Config`, live-editable "},{"id":"p22s6","text":"`.volatile()` fields), so changes apply without a restart.\n- ✅ **DSH 0.2.0-rc.1 — verified compatibl"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"e**: the peer range now covers both lines (`^0.1.7-rc.1 || ^0.2.0-rc.1`) and `dsh.compatibility.dshR"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"eleases` adds `\"0.2.0-rc.1\": \"compatible\"` — verified on a real 0.2.0-rc.1 host and a shadow instanc"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"e. Since 0.2 the host gates profile bundles on peer compatibility and **skips the whole bundle** whe"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"n the declared range misses the running host, so this range is what keeps the plugin loading.\n- ⚠️ *"},{"id":"p22s11","text":"*DSH 0.1.5 and older — install the previous tag `v0.3.2`**: that line keeps the old behavior and use"},{"id":"p22s12","text":"s no 0.1.7-only API.\n- ⛔ **Old plugin releases (up to `v0.3.2`) are not supported on 0.1.7** — no kn"},{"id":"p22s13","text":"own behavior regression — it only lacks the localized plugin metadata. Upgrade the plugin together w"},{"id":"p22s14","text":"ith the host.\n- **Maintenance policy**: **discontinued (2026-10-01)** — no longer tracks new DSH rel"},{"id":"p22s15","text":"eases; compatibility of the existing releases with older DSH versions is best-effort only and not gu"},{"id":"p22s16","text":"aranteed going forward."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Your DSH version | Install this | Note |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| 0.1.0-rc.6 and newer (incl. 0.1.1-rc.1/rc.2) | `main` (v0.3.2+) | **Best effort** — 3-arg call wit"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"h auto-degrade to 2 args on rc.6/rc.7 (verified locally on rc.6/rc.8, not guaranteed) |\n| **0.1.5-rc"},{"id":"p24s3","text":".1** | `main` (v0.3.2+) | ✅ **Verified**: the official slot catalog still declares `conversation.inp"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ut.left` (`occupants: []`, `replaceRisk: none`) — no migration needed; the official Plan chip only *"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"exits* plan mode, and the official README states there is deliberately no inactive affordance (which"},{"id":"p24s6","text":" this plugin provides) |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Host** (`lib/index.js`): no behavior — this is a pure UI plugin; the client half is discovered t"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"hrough the `dsh.client` declaration in `package.json` (`exports[\"./client\"]`).\n- **Client** (`lib/cl"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ient.js`): registers the checklist icon button in the `conversation.input.left` seat using official "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"DSW design tokens (follows dark/light theme); reads plan state live through `useProjection(\"plan\")`;"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" clicking executes the official `/plan` command via `ctx.remote.commands.execute(sessionId, \"/plan\","},{"id":"p26s6","text":" [])` — the whole flow stays on the official command chain.\n- **State handling**: the effective plan"},{"id":"p26s7","text":" state mirrors the official PlanChip algorithm (`pending ? !active : active`). While plan mode is ac"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"tive the button returns `null` (hidden — the official plan card owns the indicator, no duplicate); w"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"hile a toggle is pending the button is disabled so a second click can't reverse the switch; command "},{"id":"p26s10","text":"failures turn the button error-colored with the message in its tooltip."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
